---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout title="关于我 / About" description={`关于 ${siteConfig.author}（拼音：${siteConfig.romanizedName}）：一名在杭州的在校学生与开源主义者。`}>
  <div data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="page-hero container about-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span lang="en">About</span> · 关于我</span>
      <h1>你好呀，我是<br />{siteConfig.author}。</h1>
      <p class="about-hero-en" lang="en">Hi there, I’m {siteConfig.romanizedName} (pinyin), a student based in Hangzhou.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="container about-grid personal-about-grid">
      <aside class="about-card personal-about-card">
        <div class="about-avatar about-avatar-han" aria-hidden="true">{siteConfig.profile.initial}</div>
        <h2>{siteConfig.author}</h2>
        <p lang="en">{siteConfig.romanizedName} · Pinyin</p>
        <dl class="profile-facts">
          <div><dt>身份 / <span lang="en">Role</span></dt><dd>{siteConfig.profile.role} · <span lang="en">{siteConfig.profile.roleEn}</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt>坐标 / <span lang="en">Base</span></dt><dd>{siteConfig.profile.location} · <span lang="en">Hangzhou</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt>相信 / <span lang="en">Belief</span></dt><dd lang="en">Open Source</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span lang="en">GitHub</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a>
          <a class="button" lang="en" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>Email</a>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="about-content personal-about-content">
        <section>
          <span class="language-label">中文 / ZH</span>
          <p>你好呀，我是徐丰俊，目前是一名在校学生，坐标杭州。</p>
          <blockquote><p>{siteConfig.tagline}</p></blockquote>
          <p>我喜欢天马星空的项目，也是一名坚定的开源主义者。</p>
          <p>这个网站用来放我的简单介绍和公开联系方式。</p>
        </section>

        <section lang="en">
          <span class="language-label">ENGLISH / EN</span>
          <p>Hi there, I’m Xu Fengjun (pinyin), a student based in Hangzhou.</p>
          <blockquote><p>{siteConfig.taglineEn}</p></blockquote>
          <p>I enjoy imaginative projects and am a committed believer in open source.</p>
          <p>This website contains a short introduction and my public contact details.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>关于我 <small lang="en">/ About me</small></h2>
          <div class="principles">
            <div class="principle"><strong>天马星空 / <span lang="en">Imagination</span></strong><p>我喜欢富有想象力的项目。</p><p lang="en">I enjoy imaginative projects.</p></div>
            <div class="principle"><strong>开源主义 / <span lang="en">Open source</span></strong><p>我是一名坚定的开源主义者。</p><p lang="en">I’m a committed believer in open source.</p></div>
            <div class="principle"><strong>在校学习 / <span lang="en">Student</span></strong><p>我目前是一名在校学生。</p><p lang="en">I am currently a student.</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>保持联系 <small lang="en">/ Contact</small></h2>
          <p>我目前不求职，也不接单。不过想打个招呼的话，可以通过 <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>邮件</a>、<a href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span lang="en">GitHub</span><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a> 或 <a href={siteConfig.social.bilibili} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">哔哩哔哩<span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a> 找到我。</p>
          <p lang="en">I’m not currently looking for work or taking commissions. You can still say hello by email, GitHub, or Bilibili.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
